# ## Security Attestation
# This ClawHub package contains marketplace metadata, installable xCloud skill instructions, runtime references, assets, and the shared REST wrapper. It ships no real API tokens and does not run network calls during installation.
#
# ## What This Package Does Not Do
# - Does not collect credentials.
# - Does not include real API tokens.
# - Does not run API calls on install.
# - Does not execute repository-only smoke tests from the marketplace package.
# - Does not include generated dist output, repository docs, legacy source helpers, or internal work-step notes.
#
# ## Maintainer
# xCloudDev - https://github.com/xCloudDev
